                                                "sense_id": "7e4a8faa-2eb2-3685-9b00-c9ef40a6b17d",
                                                "text": "When we were sleeping together, we knew we had to be secretive. I would creep into her cell after Profound Silence. Her cell was next to the subprioress's cell. We waited for the wonderful tell-tale signal of the subprioress snoring."
